  {
    "id": "D03",
    "repo": "Open330/aas",
    "language": "Korean",
    "publishable_as_is": false,
    "reasons": [
      "The subject and action do not agree naturally in \"aas는 … 계정을 여러 개 등록해 두고 명령 하나로 바꿔 씁니다.\" The person registers and uses the accounts; aas manages or switches them. With aas as the explicit subject, \"바꿔 씁니다\" makes the tool sound as though it uses the accounts itself. This needs a grammatical rewrite, not merely a stylistic preference."
    ],
    "what_author_would_change": "Change the first sentence to \"aas에 Claude Code, Codex 같은 코딩 에이전트 계정을 여러 개 등록해 두면 명령 하나로 계정을 바꿔 쓸 수 있습니다.\" Keep the remaining usage sentence and link."
  },
